{"id":"steam-545550","steam":545550,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Harvester of the dead","summary":"Uncover the dark story of the 'Harvester of the Dead' in this pixel art Metroidvania. \r\nBattle infernal bosses, explore mysterious worlds, gain experience, and unlock powerful spells as you fight to close the gates of hell!","about":"Dive into the pixelated universe of Harvester of the Dead, an action-platformer game inspired by Metroidvania!\n\nDiscover a dark story where you must explore various environments and seal the great gate of hell.\n\nAlong the way, prepare to face fantastic creatures, improve your skills, and become the legendary Harvester of the Dead.\n\nKey Features:\n\n• \nExplore different environments throughout your journey to close the gates of hell!\n• \nFind all the rifts to hell and recover the keys to seal the great gate.\n• \nAlternate between platforming phases and intense combat.\n• \nFight zombies, undead, and other creatures in randomly generated dungeons.\n• \nUse melee weapons, ranged weapons, or magical weapons.\n• \nBattle huge bosses in randomly generated rifts to hell!\n• \nGain experience, level up, and unlock new skills.\n• \nCustomize your character from the start: appearance and clothing!\n• \nHelp NPCs by completing their quests and gain new equipment, or visit the shop to upgrade your character!\n• \nExperience an epic atmosphere with a captivating orchestral soundtrack!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545550/library_600x900.jpg?t=1762312180","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545550/header.jpg?t=1762312180","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545550/library_hero.jpg?t=1762312180","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545550/header.jpg?t=1762312180","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545550/page_bg_generat